# Checklist for Course Management Test

- [ ] Navigate to http://localhost:3000/instructor/courses
- [ ] Select a course and go to edit
- [ ] Test 1: Course Active toggle in Global Visibility and observe the alert
- [ ] Test 2: Toggle a Section to inactive in Curriculum section and see visual line-through/dimming
- [ ] Test 3: Open 'Add Lesson' modal, type title, select 'Video', paste YouTube URL, verify 'Interactive Preview'
- [ ] Test 4: Delete a lesson and verify it disappears from UI
